 0.4568764568764569, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.4700854700854701}, {"text": "facts seem to alter with an altered voice.", "x0": 0.22197802197802197, "y0": 0.4731934731934732, "x1": 0.532967032967033, "y1": 0.48329448329448327}, {"text": "From THE LEFT HAND OF DARKNESS by Ursula K. Le Guin \u00a9 1969 by Ursula K. Le Guin, Used by", "x0": 0.2230769230769231, "y0": 0.4965034965034965, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.519036519036519}, {"text": "permission of Ace Books, an imprint of the Berkley Publishing Group, a division of Penguin Group (USA) Inc.", "x0": 0.18681318681318682, "y0": 0.5151515151515151, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.526029526029526}, {"text": "Use all or part of the provided text in a piece of imaginative writing that reflects your", "x0": 0.16373626373626374, "y0": 0.5446775446775447, "x1": 0.8362637362637363, "y1": 0.5578865578865578}, {"text": "understanding of the ways lives are explored in Life Writing.", "x0": 0.16263736263736264, "y0": 0.5617715617715617, "x1": 0.6373626373626373, "y1": 0.574980574980575}, {"text": "Question 3 \u2014 Elective 2: Crime Writing (25 marks)", "x0": 0.16373626373626374, "y0": 0.6091686091686092, "x1": 0.5868131868131868, "y1": 0.6231546231546231}, {"text": "Write an essay in which you explore the interplay of the traditional and the innovative", "x0": 0.16263736263736264, "y0": 0.6425796425796426, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.6557886557886557}, {"text": "in Crime Writing.", "x0": 0.16373626373626374, "y0": 0.6596736596736597, "x1": 0.3010989010989011, "y1": 0.6721056721056721}, {"text": "In your response, refer to TWO prescribed texts AND texts of your own choosing.", "x0": 0.16263736263736264, "y0": 0.6907536907536908, "x1": 0.8010989010989011, "y1": 0.703962703962704}, {"text": "Question 4- Elective 2: Crime Writing (25 marks)", "x0": 0.16373626373626374, "y0": 0.7381507381507382, "x1": 0.5681318681318681, "y1": 0.7513597513597513}, {"text": "Sometimes the best weapon is...", "x0": 0.162637362637